From be6f468851a6212443b6039ea6e4ff44d6729ce2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: upload-security <noreply@example.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:12:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden image/video upload security

- Inspect file content (magic bytes), not file.type/name; store extension and Content-Type from content
- Strip EXIF/GPS/XMP and trailing payloads from JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP (lossless, keeps animation + JPEG rotation)
- Verify MP4/MOV/WebM containers and scrub GPS/device boxes from MP4/MOV
- Refuse SVG/HTML, executables, double extensions, macro Office files; allow-list chat attachments
- Clean attachment file names; check voice notes (container + 5 MB)
- Signed-URL helper so chat media can be served from private buckets
- Migrations (NOT applied): bucket/extension allow-lists, private chat-media + voice, optional public listing lockdown
- Tests: 52 new unit/wiring/component tests and SQL policy assertions
